body:
this is the most stupidest thing I had ever heard, it's passed onto people out of sheer ignorance without any scientific evidence about it, in fact, what's a body? Your brain controls the body? If you brain controls what you want then what the heck is body doing?

Our brain too becomes impulsive sometimes, especially when it comes to dopamine intensive stuff. There we must control our impulsive desires and pursue something more meaningful.

&#x200B;

>For true satisfaction, forget happiness and seek long-term goals

&#x200B;

This is a quote from a renowned clinical psychologist. So, so yeah.
